[{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0459","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0459.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0886","title":"Cisco CBOS TCP/IP协议栈拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco CBOS 宽带操作系统 TCP/IP 协议栈存在内存消耗拒绝服务漏洞。运行 CBOS 2.4.4 及更早版本的 Cisco DSL CPE 设备中，TCP/IP 协议栈在处理超大尺寸数据包时存在内存分配缺陷。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标设备的 DHCP 端口（67/68）、Telnet 端口（23）发送特制大包，或向 CPE 设备发送大量大包洪流，触发 TCP/IP 协议栈过度消耗系统内存，导致设备挂起或崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞无需认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0886"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:19Z","remediation":"升级 Cisco CBOS 至 2.4.5 或更高版本（Cisco Bug ID CSCdx36121 已修复此问题）。由于 Cisco 600 系列 DSL CPE 路由器已停产且不再提供固件更新，建议立即更换为受支持的 Cisco 设备。临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙上限制对 DHCP（UDP 67/68）和 Telnet（TCP 23）端口的访问，仅允许来自可信管理网络的连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/CBOS-DoS.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9151.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9153.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4813","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4814","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4815","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/9152","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21472","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2002/CVE-2002-0886.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0886.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0886","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0886.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0886.md","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-0886.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0886.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0886.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/a5f32c7015b5096d8cfd855ae981350d42219587/2002/CVE-2002-0886.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0886.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0459.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0458","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0458.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0879","title":"Gafware CFXImage ShowTemp 文件泄漏漏洞","description":"Gafware CFXImage 1.6.4 及 1.6.6 版本的 showtemp.cfm 脚本存在路径遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 FILE 参数传入 `..` 跨目录序列或 `C:` 风格绝对路径读取服务器上的任意文件，导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需构造特制 HTTP 请求即可利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0879"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:19Z","remediation":"立即删除或重命名 `showtemp.cfm` 文件，该文件仅为演示用途，非 CFXImage 核心组件。如业务需要类似功能，在 ColdFusion 应用层对 `FILE` 参数做严格路径白名单过滤，禁止包含 `..`、`../` 及盘符绝对路径（如 `C:\\`）。建议将 CFXImage 升级至 1.6.6 以上版本（如存在），或迁移至其他受维护的 ColdFusion 图像处理组件替代。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0256.html","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9196.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4882","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21493","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0879.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0879.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0879","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0879.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0879.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2002/CVE-2002-0879.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0879.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0879.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0879.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0879.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0458.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0457","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0457.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0876","title":"Evolvable Shambala Server 4.5 HTTP请求拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Evolvable Shambala Server 4.5 的 Web 服务器组件存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的畸形 HTTP 请求，触发服务器处理异常导致崩溃，造成服务不可用。该漏洞无需身份认证即可远程利用，攻击复杂度低，但仅影响服务可用性，不涉及数据泄露或篡改。CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。目前已有公开的 PoC 利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0876"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:18Z","remediation":"Shambala Server 4.5 已停止维护且无官方补丁，建议立即迁移至 Apache 或 Nginx 等现代 Web 服务器。临时缓解措施：在网络边界防火墙或反向代理层面过滤包含异常字符（如单个 `!` 后跟 `\\r\\n`）的畸形 HTTP 请求，并限制仅允许可信 IP 访问服务器 80 端口。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-05/0282.html","http://online.securityfocus.com/archive/1/281265","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9225.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/4897","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21498","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/f7f0337cfdc7d8aab4c9eb0d8a44be53baa8f88d/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0876.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4ca6e07c2a2a0094c502e8dff7bec24959ab07fd/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0876.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0876","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0876.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0876.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/51172ac815e3679269b063a6e72648b897f17276/2002/CVE-2002-0876.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/d6e5bf87d27954c5a3cd48e565b212fb97932a81/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0876.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/68a8e7c8b5d4a203080f3ef6d3d4e3df346511fe/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0876.md","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0876.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelist-dev/blob/5b8fbb570438e8094550205589cc6f1d122acc94/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0876.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0457.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0292","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0292.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1132","title":"SquirrelMail SquirrelMail 绝对路径泄露漏洞","description":"SquirrelMail 1.2.7 及更早版本存在信息泄露漏洞，攻击者可通过向 options.php 脚本发送构造不当的 optpage 文件参数，触发服务器返回错误消息，从而获取该脚本的绝对路径。该漏洞无需身份认证即可利用，影响 SquirrelMail 1.2.7 及之前所有版本。攻击者利用此漏洞可获取服务器文件系统结构信息，为后续进一步攻击提供便利条件。CVSS 评分为 5.0，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1132"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:47Z","remediation":"升级 SquirrelMail 至 1.2.8 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，建议在 php.ini 中将 display_errors 设置为 Off，通过禁用 Web 服务器的详细错误显示来防止绝对路径泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-09/0246.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-191","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10345.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-204.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5949","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cd696685415f2042291d9e0384b081621f3c1f4b/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1132.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1132","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ef75ce172dfcb1356ff39d845afc3279616b6768/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1132.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1132.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/0ee4b319dbbebe5eb09eced345bd3bf53e62e6fa/2002/CVE-2002-1132.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-1132.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/785e77b4ad6bd2b2f4df37d5c69bed8d2eb6ddec/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1132.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/c874c570db2fe89bdd760e343e06f2482ade4fe8/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-11xx/CVE-2002-1132.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-1132.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1132.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0292.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0289","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0289.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1119","title":"Python os._execvpe 临时文件符号链接攻击本地代码执行漏洞","description":"Python 2.2.1 及更早版本的 os._execvpe 函数在创建临时文件时采用了可预测的命名机制。本地攻击者可以通过在预测的临时文件路径中创建恶意符号链接（Symlink Attack），诱导高权限进程在执行相关操作时覆盖或写入敏感文件，从而实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本的 Python 环境，攻击条件为攻击者需具备本地用户权限，可通过操纵文件系统层级的临时文件链接完成利用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1119"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:45Z","remediation":"建议将 Python 环境升级至 2.2.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 os._execvpe 创建临时文件时的可预测性问题。若无法立即升级，可通过限制 /tmp 等临时目录的权限（如设置 Sticky Bit）或使用更安全的临时文件创建 API 来缓解符号链接攻击风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000527","http://mail.python.org/pipermail/python-dev/2002-August/027229.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=104333092200589&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-159","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10009.php","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2002/MDKSA-2002-082.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-202.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-048.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5581","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-1119.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1119.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1119.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1119","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1119.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1119.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d7a076478478ace961ac114128fbcbb4e54a11aa/2002/CVE-2002-1119.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1119.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1119.md","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/de5e978a48281a824409de119a9380c20aa11e39/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1119.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0289.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0288","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0288.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-1091","title":"Netscape/Mozilla 浏览器 GIF 图像处理远程代码执行漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Netscape 6.2.3 及更早版本以及 Mozilla 1.0.1 浏览器中。漏洞原理在于浏览器在处理 GIF 图像时，未能正确校验图像宽度，导致在处理宽度为零的特制 GIF 图片时发生堆内存损坏。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问含有恶意 GIF 图像的网页，在无需身份验证的情况下触发此漏洞，从而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响早期版本的 Netscape 和 Mozilla 浏览器，危害等级较高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1091"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:42Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Netscape 6.2.3 及更早版本以及 Mozilla 1.0.1 浏览器，升级至更新的安全版本或迁移至现代浏览器（如 Firefox）。对于无法立即迁移的系统，建议在网关层面拦截或过滤异常构造的 GIF 图像文件，以减轻远程代码执行风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=157989","http://crash.ihug.co.nz/~Sneuro/zerogif/","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103134051120770&w=2","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10058.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:075","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-192.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-046.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5665","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2002/CVE-2002-1091.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/231116aa5795023b4be954f9aed84939e97cf046/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1091.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-1091.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-1091.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1091","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1091.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-1091.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/850a5c12479fcc3145fda9fa79403efdef7fb609/2002/CVE-2002-1091.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-1091.json","https://github.com/brenonevs/prs-pentest/blob/001cf17eedeb4aad73618d3140ca1f5dc93e69b3/CVEs & POCs/2002/CVE-2002-1091.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2002/POC-AVE-2002-0288.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0288.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0265","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0265.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0837","title":"wordtrans-web 代码执行跨站脚本漏洞","description":"wordtrans-web 包中 wordtrans 1.1pre8 及更早版本的 wordtrans.php 脚本存在输入验证缺陷，导致攻击者可通过某些参数（如 dict）传输恶意数据。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此漏洞执行任意代码或实施跨站脚本攻击，威胁网站服务器安全。该漏洞影响范围限于 wordtrans-web 软件，攻击者无需任何权限即可远程触发，通过精心构造的参数实现代码执行或页面劫持，潜在地威胁网站完整性和用户数据安全。Microsoft 及相关安全厂商已发布补丁，用户需及时更新至安全版本以防护此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0837"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:13Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 wordtrans-web 到 1.2 或更高版本以获取官方安全修复。当无法立即更新时，建议（1）通过 WAF 禁用 wordtrans.php 路径访问，（2）限制访问来源 IP，（3）对 dict 等参数进行严格过滤验证，（4）启用 PHP 安全模式限制 shell 执行，并在升级后验证所有参数验证逻辑。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103158607631137&w=2","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2002-188.html","http://www.guardent.com/comp_news_wordtrans-web.html#","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10059.php","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10063.php","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5671","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5674","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0837.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0837","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0837.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0837.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/f187e7be682488cc782059fd6bb7b453289ef42b/2002/CVE-2002-0837.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0837.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0837.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0837.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2002/CVE-2002-0837.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0837.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0265.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0261","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0261.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0835","title":"HP Secure OS 1.0 Preboot eXecution Environment 服务器拒绝服务漏洞","description":"HP Secure OS 1.0 中的预启动执行环境（PXE）服务器存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过网络向目标系统发送来自 VoIP 电话的特定 DHCP 数据包，触发 PXE 服务器解析异常导致服务崩溃。该漏洞影响 HP Secure OS 1.0 版本，攻击者只需具备网络访问能力即可实施攻击，成功利用后可造成 PXE 服务中断，影响网络启动与系统部署功能。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0835"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:13Z","remediation":"立即更新 HP-UX 系统，安装最新的内核补丁和安全更新包。禁用未经验证的PXE服务器服务或限制其接入源IP地址，通过严格验证DHCP请求和实现流控机制来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4449","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10003.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-162.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-165.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5596","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0835.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0835","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a237fbd576a7286b31323c79c10e5d8ddb9ad316/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0835.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/9dff795a9a7b58dca025b22ebdb342ecc8354f50/2002/CVE-2002-0835.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0835.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2002-0835.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/ef1766e2b390160881db9b8bb9c1bb8bfb197a80/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0835.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/5ff0b9e6ad0b51b419967392a23ca6a8c4176810/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-08xx/CVE-2002-0835.json","https://github.com/CyberSecAI/cve_info/blob/03b7e36424574a3a9ba5fd13480a326b666a1046/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0835.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/6ccaaffc515caa9809eafc85eced3a0696abe41f/content/CVE-2002-0835.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0261.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0224","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0224.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0662","title":"ScrollKeeper 不安全临时文件名本地文件覆盖漏洞","description":"ScrollKeeper 0.3 到 0.3.11 版本中的 scrollkeeper-get-cl 函数存在不安全的临时文件处理漏洞。攻击者可利用符号链接攻击机制，在用户执行 ScrollKeeper 操作时，创建指向任意目标文件的符号链接。当 vulnerable 函数尝试写入临时文件时，实际会写入到目标文件的位置，导致本地用户能够任意创建和覆盖文件。该漏洞主要影响 Linux 系统中安装了 ScrollKeeper 软件包的用户，可能导致文件权限提升或系统文件破坏。攻击者无需网络权限，仅需本地访问权限即可发起攻击，利用难度较低。此类漏洞常被用作本地提权攻击的初始破坏手段，可进一步获取系统控制权或安装恶意软件。Microsoft Security Response Center 已确认此漏洞，并建议用户升级到最新版本的 ScrollKeeper，彻底修复此安全问题。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0662"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:53Z","remediation":"建议将 ScrollKeeper 升级至 0.3.14-11ubuntu6 或更高版本（该版本已修复 scrollkeeper-get-cl 中 scrollkeeper-tempfile.x 临时文件的符号链接攻击，通过安全的临时文件创建方式替代可预测的文件名）。对于 Debian/Ubuntu 系统，可通过 apt 执行 apt update && apt upgrade scrollkeeper 完成升级。如暂时无法升级，可临时设置环境变量 TMPDIR 指向非共享的 /var/tmp 以外目录（如 /home/user/tmp），并确保该目录具有严格访问权限（chmod 700），以降低本地用户通过符号链接创建和覆写文件的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103098575826031&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=103115387102294&w=2","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-160","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/10002.php","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-186.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5602","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2002/CVE-2002-0662.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/676b40fa5dad82f5f5be4cb920867579d5869c49/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0662.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2002/CVE-2002-0662.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2002/CVE-2002-0662.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0662","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/0c8771e89b9e76278d77bdb22e6a7f5061b52570/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0662.json","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2002-0662","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2002-0662","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2002/CVE-2002-0662.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2002-0662"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2002/AVE-2002-0224.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2002-0188","file_name":"2002/AVE-2002-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2002-0384","title":"Gaim Jabber 插件缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Gaim 客户端 0.58 之前版本中的 Jabber 插件存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制的 Jabber 消息触发该漏洞，导致任意代码执行。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞，成功利用后可完全控制受影响的 Gaim 客户端系统，危害严重。用户需升级至 Gaim 0.58 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2002-0384"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:57:19Z","remediation":"升级Gaim客户端至0.58或更高版本。Red Hat已发布RHSA-2002:098、RHSA-2002:107、RHSA-2002:122等安全公告提供修复补丁，建议用户及时更新。Mandrake用户可参考MDKSA-2002:054获取对应补丁。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://frontal2.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:054","http://online.securityfocus.com/advisories/4358","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9766.php","http://www.osvdb.org/3729","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-098.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-107.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-122.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2003-156.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5406","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0118bdf83d51e7ec6262ccd7acc694cb751b5bf8/cves/2002/0xxx/CVE-2002-0384.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-0384","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-0384.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2002/CVE-2002-0384.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09e0