有版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。建议用户升级至 HylaFAX 4.1.3 或更高版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2002-1049"],"sources":["osv"],"published":"2002-10-04T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:58:37Z","remediation":"升级 HylaFAX 至 4.1.3 或更高版本。该版本已修复 faxgetty 组件处理 TSI 数据元素时的格式化字符串漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 /etc/inetd.conf 中注释 faxgetty 服务行并重启 inetd 以临时禁用传真接收功能；或在防火墙层面限制对 faxgetty 服务端口（通常为 4559/tcp）的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2002-07/0358.html","http://bugs.hylafax.org/bugzilla/show_bug.cgi?id=300","http://www.debian.org/security/2002/dsa-148","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/9728.php","http://www.mandrakesoft.com/security/advisories?name=MDKSA-2002:055","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2002_035_hylafax.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5002","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/5348","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7d4778b18ea29de57c8a889212050a9d38e2d2cb/cves/2002/1xxx/CVE-2002-1049.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2002/CVE-2002-1049","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2002-1049.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/CVE/data/2002/CVE-2002-1049.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-2qfv-hf75-cqrh/GHSA-2qfv-hf75-cqrh.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-148.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--d5a0dbe4-96c5-46b8-b51a-f4276b3cd499.json","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/264183bcd01e2c9ec3804dc74ef248df8e8380e5/tracker/DSA/DSA-148.json","h